===Etymology===
{{inh+|pl|zlw-opl|kaczka}}, from {{inh|pl|sla-pro|*kačьka}}, a West Slavic innovation of {{onom|pl|nocap=1}} origin (for the duck's cry) which replaced {{ncog|sla-pro|*ǫtь|t=duck}} in West Slavic. Cognates include {{cog|cs|kachna}}, {{m|cs|kačka}}, and {{cog|sk|kačka}}, {{m|sk|kačica}}.<ref>{{R:pl:Boryś|kaczka|218}}</ref>

